---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(281) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Weekly Pool Cleaning in Spring, TX | Professional Maintenance" description="Reliable weekly pool cleaning in Spring, TX. Skim, brush, vacuum, chemical balancing, and equipment checks. Keep your pool crystal clear.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Weekly Pool Cleaning</h1>
      <p>Consistent care that keeps your Spring pool sparkling and safe all season.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Our weekly pool cleaning service is the foundation of healthy water. On a regular schedule we visit your Spring property, perform a full maintenance checklist, and leave your pool ready for swimming.</p>
      <h2>What We Do Every Visit</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Test and balance chlorine, pH, alkalinity, calcium hardness, and cyanuric acid</li>
        <li>Skim surface debris and empty skimmer &amp; pump baskets</li>
        <li>Brush walls, steps, and tile line</li>
        <li>Vacuum the floor</li>
        <li>Check filter pressure and backwash or clean as needed</li>
        <li>Inspect pump, motor, and visible equipment for early warning signs</li>
        <li>Leave a brief service note so you know what was done</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Why Weekly Service Matters in Spring</h2>
      <p>Harris County heat, pollen, and hard water accelerate chemical demand and debris load. Skipping weeks often leads to cloudy water or algae that costs more to fix than regular maintenance.</p>
      <h2>Ready to Start?</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>{phoneDisplay}</a> to get on a route near 18913 Tomato St or request a free quote for your address.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Weekly Service</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
